Frozen source files and source IDs are preserved. No new map requests were made.
Mapped-area graph edges are computed derived data from the frozen R4-REV1 input,
not independently surveyed walking paths. Conditional routes are hypotheses.
This package contains no map-service API keys, paid-service activation, or images
from restricted commercial map clients. Local HTTP service only.
